# Terraform / OpenTofu working state never enters the repository (deploy/aws/procedures/PROVISIONING.md).
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Per-activation inputs: account ids, the owner's references and the backend's bucket live with the owner, not here.
backend.hcl
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
# The bootstrap's temporary local backend (PROVISIONING.md "Bootstrap").
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
